WEBVTT

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.880
Look, you're getting drenched.
Come under the umbrella--

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.790
Wait up.
Wait up, please!

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:39.490
Godai!

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.470
It's all right.
I'm not angry.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.560
Really?

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:53.430
Really.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.110
Nonchalance...

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:07.100
And I was so close!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:20.320
All club presidents must be in
the conference room at 3:OO PM!

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:28.180
All club presidents must be in
the conference room at 3:OO PM!

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:32.710
Manager!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:39.720
Godai...

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:42.850
I...

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:45.280
You've finally
accepted my love?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.840
So that's your fetish?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:22.340
I'm home!

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:26.350
Godai...

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.350
...may I come to
your school festival?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.750
School festival?
MY school festival?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:33.780
Yes!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.540
I'll be sure not to
get in your way.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.200
Get in my way!?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.350
That's im--possible!

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:43.690
I'll show you the campus!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.280
Front to back!
Top to bottom!

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:52.300
But isn't your club performing?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.110
You deserve a guide!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.140
But I shouldn't--

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.540
--'Scuse me.
--You won't be--

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.240
Akemi!
Welcome home.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:04.370
Comin' through.
Creeeek.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.670
Look at you kids,
playin' house in the hallway.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.340
Puppy love--

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.360
You're wrong! There is
NOTHING between us!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.930
Yeah, I know.
G'night.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:25.980
Honestly...

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.700
Good night.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:39.760
Geez!

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:42.580
She didn't have to...

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.030
...deny it...

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.540
...that strongly.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.470
But still--

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.520
The festival was
just an excuse.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.920
My true desire was
to be alone with you!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.340
I have longed to
hear those words.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.420
Godai...

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.400
The manager's coming
to my school festival!

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.000
All right!
Way to go!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.640
She's coming to
my school festival!

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.140
Don't know what you're celebratin',
but I got the drinks.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.130
Your treat?

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.000
--Cheers!
--Cheers!

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:54.590
Allow me the pleasure
of your company.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.140
Can it be true?

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.350
The manager at
your college festival?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:01.500
That's right.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:02.820
What for?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.390
''What for''?
'Cause it's a festival!

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.070
There's something
behind it.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.940
No doubt about it!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.590
What do you mean,
''something''?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.640
Probability number 1 :

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:20.390
A simple apology for the
Mamezo/Ma Maison incident.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:22.930
Probability number 2:

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.680
She's going on a lark.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.680
Probability number 3:

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.110
She may not
be going alone.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.140
Festivals are
no fun alone.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.860
I-- I'LL be there!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.300
I wonder who
will accompany her?

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:39.060
That tennis coach!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:39.090
I'm so jealous!
That tennis coach!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.840
I'm so jealous!

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.430
Stop jumping
to conclusions!

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:46.140
Here I was
in a good mood--

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.310
Delusions are
bad for your health.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.150
Such amusement.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.940
I love a good beer!

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:32.290
See you!

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:36.810
I'm off, Manager.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.790
Do your best
at the festival.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:43.790
Umm...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:45.580
Yes?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:47.640
Manager!

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:48.730
Yes?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.690
Were you coming
on your own?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.530
I thought I would.
Is there a problem--?

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.530
NO! I'll wait
for you there.

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.140
I'm comin' too!

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.280
So where we goin'?

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.980
Godais college festival.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.820
What's a college festival?

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:10.250
It's something way
above a child's understanding.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:14.200
Where only obscure reports and
research results are displayed.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.990
My goodness!
I didn't know!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.930
No! It's not that!

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.780
Then what IS it?

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.940
Well it's--
I mean--

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.030
Fried octopus, sweet buns,
sweet bean soup.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:33.850
Oden shops,
ice cream shops...

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.860
...movies, plays,
even a puppet show.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.330
I'm goin'!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.490
B-But--

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.460
What are YOU doing with
my college festival's flyer?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.810
Three guesses.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.480
I don't wanna guess!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.830
Cut the complaining.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:00.780
Yeah, everyone's
decided to come along!

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:05.020
Everyone is? Godai,
we'll look for you there.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:09.330
I'll see you.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:21.570
--Are you all right, Godai?
--A watermelon-eating contest?

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.940
--I suppose they still do that.
--I can't see.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.290
Wow. Big place.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:10:00.870
I'm impressed.
He comes here every day?

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.820
Revenge of the Monsters!
Revenge of the Monsters!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.940
The next showing
begins exactly at 12l.OO!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.660
--It's cheap!
--The best!

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.440
Delivery!
Delivery!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:29.250
This college festival is
just like the summer fair.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.610
You're right.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.810
Can I interest
you in flowers?

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:33.660
Okay.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.200
In truth, it is I.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.170
Shall we proceed?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.240
So what DOES Mr. Yotsuya
do for a living?

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:56.220
We've discussed
that before.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.930
''Hi! Want some candy?''

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.280
Don't be afraid.
It's all right.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.670
Mr. President, will you go away?

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.460
You're frightening
the children!

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:30.120
I'm so lonely!

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:35.040
I should have gone in for a
high-class club like drama.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:38.810
C'mon. You wouldn't have
even made stage crew.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:45.990
But even still...

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.360
Hey, no peeking
through the curtains.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:02.350
Kyoko's late.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.910
C'mon, Ma!
You're embarassin' me!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:41.380
They drank our best
home brew sake!

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:46.830
And every last drop of our
peerless name-brand sake!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.470
I suspected
this would happen.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.560
It's a whole different world!

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:11.340
If I hadn't met Soichiro
odds are I'd also be--

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.110
Here's some oden!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.460
Try some oden?

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:54.840
You'd like oden, right?

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.510
Then how about you?

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.470
Oden, here!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:00.000
Come one, come all!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.610
It's Godais manager!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.160
Right. And you're
Godais friend--

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.750
Sakamoto.
Want some oden?

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:13.710
I didn't recognize you. You look
younger than the other coeds.

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:16.820
Come on. I really am college age.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:21.520
But since I've been married
I guess that tends to age you!.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.110
That's not true at all.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.910
''Please do not go!
I beg of you!''

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.640
''Princess, do not stop me!''

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.470
''Will you cast me aside,
and go off to battle?''

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.980
''If I do not go,
who will?''

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:43.090
''My prince! I love you!''

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:47.320
''Nothing you can say will deter me.
A prince must go to battle.''

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:55.370
--''Prince, we must be off.''
--''Yes, let us be off.''

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:58.650
''Prince, do you not
see me begging you?''

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.550
So Godai's the prince?

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.200
I've seen that woman before.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:11.250
''Monster, I, the prince, will
deal your just punishment!''

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.260
''I am invincible!''

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:22.820
That was boring!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.020
What was that?

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.300
Dumb, too!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:28.090
Now wasn't that fun?

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.330
Come again!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.340
Is she here yet?

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:45.420
No fair! You could have
told me you were here.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.670
I couldn't
interrupt the play.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.700
You're on your own?

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:55.250
Sorry. The others took
an interest in another club.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.910
That's fine.
So you're alone.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:16:59.480
Y-Yes--

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:02.760
Look at Godai.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.060
Who is she?

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:05.250
I... uh--

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:10.680
She looks like you.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:13.830
M'god, she's right.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.480
Godai, you made a
puppet of your girlfriend!?

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.500
I am not his girlfriend!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.310
Isn't that right, Godai?

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:25.490
Again?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.130
Meet my
apartment manager.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.090
You're kidding!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.190
So Godai made this?

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:43.390
Well, I...

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:43.430
Don't scratch your
head with the puppet.
Well, I...

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:46.020
Don't scratch your
head with the puppet.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:50.000
Hey, why don't you take
my part and play the princess?

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.900
My boyfriend's waiting.
Please, I'm begging.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:55.730
See you!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.030
But-- I--

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:57.920
I-

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.180
What do you think?

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.930
l don't mind.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.130
Yes, but--

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.830
You'll be fine.
I can be your mentor.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.380
No. I can't.

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.240
I just can't do it!

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.690
Sure you can.
Let's give it a try.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:34.030
No! I just can't do it!

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:41.050
--''Help me! Save me!''
--She's so intense!

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:46.270
I've never seen anybody
get that into it.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.440
She's got spirit!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:53.990
That's your cue.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.510
''You shan't escape us now!''

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:00.100
''Save me!''

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:04.560
''Stop! Come back!''

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.200
So warm!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:13.190
''My prince,
where are you?''

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.680
It's great to be alive!

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.150
What's the hold up, Mr. Prince?

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:24.380
''My prince!''

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:25.670
''Prince?''

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.420
Sorry I'm late.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:31.350
''Where were you?
I've been calling for you!''

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.440
I promise I wasn't
thinking anything weird.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:37.380
--''What was that?''
--Just talking to myself.

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:44.770
What's going on?

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:54.730
Godai, say your line!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:55.950
Okay!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:57.570
It's right here!

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:01.980
Godai!

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.530
''I-I-I-I'm off to
battle the monster!''

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:10.570
''What a terrible fate!
Please do not go!''

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:11.870
Okay.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.210
--What do you mean, ''okay''!?
--Oh, yeah.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.170
What ARE you thinking?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.600
''Will you cast me aside,
and go off to battle?''

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:29.700
H-Her chest--

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:30.910
''O, Prince!.''

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:37.250
N-Now her whole body!
I'm not gonna make it!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.520
''I love you!!''

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:42.380
I love you!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.320
I love you!

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:44.560
I love you!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:45.570
I love you!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:46.570
I love you!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:46.660
l love you!
I love you!

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.530
l love you!

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:49.560
Oh, Manager!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:54.520
''Look here, Prince! I am a princess!
NOT a manager!''

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:55.370
But--

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.010
''Highness! We gonna kill
that monster or what!?''

00:20:58.910 --> 00:20:59.930
They're eating it up.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.590
Godai! What ARE you doing?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:05.510
But she's--

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.170
It's not me!
I'm following the script!

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:10.910
''Farewell, my Prince!''

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:13.440
Again...

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:14.780
Oh, Manager!

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:15.950
''Prince!''

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.820
--This is great!
--Fun!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.110
''Goodbye, my Prince!''

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.780
Manager!

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:27.620
''Get a move on!''

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:35.900
That's the first hit in
puppet club history! I'm so happy!

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:26.200
I'm sorry. It's all
because I butted in.

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:29.550
That's not true.
You were a hit.

00:22:31.010 --> 00:22:33.730
But I had a great time.

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:39.530
I couldn't go, but I wanted to
see what college life was like.

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:43.290
Oh, yeah.

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:48.700
Come to mention it, she'd be
about the age to go to college.

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:55.310
Here!

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:01.440
So you brought
them with you?

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:07.550
''Thank you so
much for today.''

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:08.940
''The pleasure was mine.''

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:13.540
''But don't get so carried away.
You ruined the play.''

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:16.860
''But you were
brushing up against me.''

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:21.790
''Like this!''

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:24.240
''Not again!''

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:28.700
''Good night.''

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.760
Poor little prince.

00:23:49.850 --> 00:23:52.570
I hurt my leg and can't
move for a couple of days.

00:23:53.190 --> 00:23:54.530
But everybody
is so nice.

00:23:54.860 --> 00:23:57.850
Coach Mitaka especially
enjoys caring for me.

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:01.900
Next: ''Sympathy Scramble!
If I Should Stumble...''

00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:05.340
Godai! Don't open the door
without knocking!
